      "source": "https://www.4cornersed.com/our-communities/bloomfield-nm/bloomfield-nm-history"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Bloomfield sits on the Trails of the Ancients Byway, a New Mexico Scenic Byway that showcases historic routes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
